node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# TypeScript's incremental build state. Excluded for a reason that bit us: `**/dist` above keeps
# the host's build output out of the context, but a stale tsbuildinfo told tsc inside the image
# that everything was already emitted — so `nest build` wrote almost nothing and the resulting
# API image had no dist/main.js at all. The image content depended on whether the developer
# happened to have built locally.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.next
**/.turbo
.git
.env
**/.env
**/*.log
